{"id":"fec568b8ee2173ba","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity.md","title":"Deterministic Communication Complexity","display":"df-deterministic-communication-complexity — Deterministic Communication Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity","aliases":["28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity","Deterministic Communication Complexity"],"display":"df-deterministic-communication-complexity — Deterministic Communication Complexity","depends_on":["[[28-df-communication-protocol]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 13.1","source_printed_pages":"271","source_pdf_pages":"297","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity</span><span>Deterministic Communication Complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deterministic-communication-complexity — Deterministic Communication Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35827b4b6670766d\" href=\"?note=35827b4b6670766d\" title=\"28-df-communication-protocol\">28-df-communication-protocol</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 13.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"271"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"297"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 为有限非空输入集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comm},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{cost}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comm},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{cost}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35827b4b6670766d\" href=\"?note=35827b4b6670766d\" title=\"28-df-communication-protocol\">28-df-communication-protocol</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\max_{(x,y)\\in X\\times Y}\\operatorname{cost}_\\Pi(x,y):\\Pi\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y),\\ \\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\ \\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)=f(x,y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\max_{(x,y)\\in X\\times Y}\\operatorname{cost}_\\Pi(x,y):\\Pi\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y),\\ \\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\ \\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)=f(x,y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Alice 可先发送固定长度的输入编号，再由 Bob 发出答案，故候选集合非空，最小值存在。这里 D 是通信模型记号，与决策树复杂度的 D 由参数类型区分。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 13.1，印刷页 271；PDF 页 297。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-communication-protocol","status":"resolved","id":"35827b4b6670766d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-communication-protocol]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-communication-protocol","status":"resolved","id":"35827b4b6670766d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y$ 为有限非空输入集，$f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{Comm},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{cost}$ 见 [[28-df-communication-protocol]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comm},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{cost}","display":false},{"tex":"D(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\max_{(x,y)\\in X\\times Y}\\operatorname{cost}_\\Pi(x,y):\\Pi\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y),\\ \\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\ \\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)=f(x,y)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1463,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"通信模型：[[28-df-communication-protocol]]、[[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]、[[28-df-randomized-communication-complexity]]。"},{"id":"8bc80ccb6d4290e0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M_f,\\chi(f)$ 见 [[28-df-communication-matrix]]；$D(f)$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]；协议矩形结论见 [[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]。"},{"id":"b74fca4eda5da9e2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Disc}_\\mu$ 见 [[28-df-discrepancy]]；$\\chi(f)$ 见 [[28-df-communication-matrix]]；$D(f)$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]；[[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]] 给协议分割界。"},{"id":"fb160a0659b0d45d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D(f)$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]。"}],"outgoing":["35827b4b6670766d"]}